{"id":"u-2174000a-b71e-4ee4-9113-bbdc02296acd","src":"community","title":"Hot Girl Full Body Workout 3-day Split","author":"Tem","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/Ftuu3L-untitled-program","desc":"Hot Girl Full Body is a balanced 3 day program for women who want to get stronger, build shape and definition, and train their whole body without spending half their private life at the gym.\n\nThree sessions per week, around 90 minutes each including cardio, cover the major muscle groups while giving extra attention to glutes, legs, back, shoulders, arms and core.\n\nThe program combines compound movements with targeted accessory work, so you are not doing endless exercises just for the sake of doing more. Each training day has a different emphasis, while the week as a whole stays balanced.\n\nIt is designed for the very normal person who wants stronger legs and glutes, a defined back and arms, a stronger core, better overall body composition and actual measurable progress, while still having evenings, weekends, work, dinners, trips and a functioning social life.\n\nTrain three times. Progress your weights. Go home.","level":["Intermediate","Beginner"],"goals":["Women's","Strength","Muscle","Athletics"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":90,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-13T00:46:10.605Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["DAY A: Legs + Back + Core","DAY B: Upper Body + Glutes + Arms","DAY C: Legs + Shoulders + Back + Inner/Outer Thigh"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Hack Squat","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}],"note":"8-12"},{"n":"Bulgarian Split Squat (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"x":4}],"note":"2x each leg\n8-10 reps"},{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}],"note":"8-12"},{"n":"Wide Grip Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}],"note":"12-15"},{"n":"Seated Row (Cable)","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}],"note":"12-15"},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}],"note":"12-15 reps"},{"n":"Cable Crunch","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}],"note":"12-